  "protocol": "MIDI channel 1 (factory) both ways. Input A/B 1-4: Bank Select MSB 00 (A) / 01 (B), LSB 00, then Program Change 0-3. Memory 1-8: Bank 50H/00H + Program 0-7. Video fader: CC#11 (factory), 0 = A, 127 = B. Transition time: CC#7 (factory), 0-127 = 0.0-4.0 s. Every other panel function (effects A/B 1-4, transition select, transformer A/B, output fade, BPM sync) is unassigned at the factory and can be given a CC (1-5, 7-31, 64-95), channel pressure or pitch bend with SysEx DT1: F0 41 <dev> 00 5B 12 <addr 3> <data> <sum> F7, Roland checksum. Note Mode (off at the factory): notes 24H/26H/28H/29H = A 1-4, 2BH/2DH/2FH/30H = B 1-4. Timing Clock F8 / Start FA / Continue FB drive BPM SYNC. MIDI Thru ON = the V-4's own messages are not sent.",
